      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Hi everyone, Iv been thinking about setting up some kind of work at home little business, so i could spend more time with chloe. I am quite creative and want something that i would enjoy doing that would make us a little bit of extra cash too. I was kind of thinking maybe special occassions gift boxes (Christmas, easter, halloween, birthdays, mothers/fathers day etc.) would be thankful for your thoughts?\nIm not behind the door, im quite clever but i haven't got the foggiest where to start with this, pointers on this would be good too please.\n😊  😕",
