      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Hi! firstly, I would say that make sure you do plenty of research before you decide on what to do. trawl the net for site that sell similar items etc. The internet is saturated with certain types of site....and also, what would your unique selling point be? it has to be something different that isnt already out there?\napart from that, i would say that if you have the drive and enthusiasm then go for it! its not going to happen overnight and it takes A LOT of hard work - but if you are passionate about it then go for it! good luck!",
